# Input

```scss
$name: data-width; $unit:px;
.card{width:attr( data-width $unit ,10px );height:attr($name$unit,1px);content:attr($name);}
.interpolated{width:attr(#{$name} #{$unit},10px);height:attr(data-height r#{em},1rem);unknown:attr(data-x #{$unit}01,0);}
.namespaced{width:attr(data-width units.$unit,10px);}
.comments{width:attr(#{$name}/**/#{$unit},10px);height:attr(data-height/* unit */$unit/* fallback */,10px);padding:attr(data-gap #{$unit}/* end */);}
.line-comment{width:attr(data-width $unit // unit
,10px);}
.suppressed{width:attr(data-width $unit
// biome-ignore format: Keep the fallback layout.
, 10px   +   2px);}
.keep{width:/* biome-ignore format: Keep the function layout. */ attr( data-width $unit,10px );}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$name: data-width;
$unit: px;
.card {
	width: attr(data-width $unit, 10px);
	height: attr($name $unit, 1px);
	content: attr($name);
}
.interpolated {
	width: attr(#{$name} #{$unit}, 10px);
	height: attr(data-height r#{em}, 1rem);
	unknown: attr(data-x #{$unit}01, 0);
}
.namespaced {
	width: attr(data-width units.$unit, 10px);
}
.comments {
	width: attr(#{$name} /**/ #{$unit}, 10px);
	height: attr(data-height /* unit */ $unit /* fallback */, 10px);
	padding: attr(data-gap #{$unit} /* end */);
}
.line-comment {
	width: attr(
		data-width
		$unit // unit
		,
		10px
	);
}
.suppressed {
	width: attr(
		data-width
		$unit
		// biome-ignore format: Keep the fallback layout.
		, 10px   +   2px
	);
}
.keep {
	width:/* biome-ignore format: Keep the function layout. */ attr( data-width $unit,10px );
}

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
   38: 	width:/* biome-ignore format: Keep the function layout. */ attr( data-width $unit,10px );
```
